  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal, by reason of the poor and cramped layout of the ground and first\r\nfloor flats , poor outlook to bedrooms and living spaces for each flat, would\r\nresult in a poor standard of living accommodation for future occupiers of those\r\nflats, to the detriment of their residential amenities,&amp;nbsp; contrary to the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2023), Policies D6 and D3, (D.7 and D.10) of The London Plan (2021),\r\nPolicies DM1 and DM26 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local\r\nPlan (2013), The Mayor of London Housing\r\nSupplementary Planning Guidance (2016), the adopted Supplementary Planning Document:\r\nResidential Design Guide (2010) and Housing Design Standards LPG (2023).&amp;nbsp;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal, by reason of the poor vertical stacking arrangement between\r\nkitchen/living areas and bedrooms would result in a poor standard of living\r\naccommodation for future occupiers of flats 1 and 2, to the detriment of their\r\nresidential amenities,&amp;nbsp; contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policies D6 and D3, (D.7 and D.10) of The London Plan (2021), Policies DM1 and DM26 of the Harrow Development\r\nManagement Policies Local Plan (2013), The Mayor of London Housing Supplementary Planning Guidance (2016), the\r\nadopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010) and\r\nHousing Design Standards LPG (2023).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposed two storey rear extension, by\r\nreason of its excessive depth, would result in a loss of outlook and\r\noverbearing impact to the first floor rear windows at No. 114 Nibthwaite Road,\r\nto the detriment of the residential amenities of the occupiers of this\r\nproperty, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(2023), Policy D3 (D.7) of The London Plan\r\n(2021), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan\r\n(2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design\r\nGuide (2010).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
